<title>SWITZERLAND: Ares-Serono details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Ares-Serono details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PERIOD to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			53.47	     vs 29.38</p>
<p> Div (bearer, Sfr)	    5.00		vs 3.00</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		2.00		vs 1.20</p>
<p> Net sales			804.99	    vs 682.30</p>
<p> Operating income	     95.87	     vs 66.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax/minority income    73.79	     vs 46.24</p>
<p> Income taxes		   20.06	     vs 14.89</p>
<p> Research spending net	158.98	    vs 144.49</p>
<p> Earnings per share (Sfr)*  14.27	    vs 7.84</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Ares-Serono SA</p>
<p>* Earnings per share data are based on assumption that 2,645,285 bearer shares and 2,753,260 registered shares (total equivalent 3,746,589 bearer shares) were outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
